# Evidence behind the account

**2026-10-31 supplement.** [Complete accepted preparation evidence](final-selection/updates/20261031/README.md) now includes all 27 author/reviewer roles and the later completion records. [Maintenance evidence](maintenance/20261031/README.md) records the compressed-log repair. Earlier accepted evidence remains unchanged.

**Latest accepted selection — 2026-10-19.** The [new package](final-selection/updates/20261018/manifest.json) preserves E036's closed version choice, the completed preparation of 22 candidates, the accepted 60/40 method, exact selected versions, and the reading result. [English decision guide](../docs/selection.md). Earlier packages below remain historical evidence.

Completion is bounded to the accepted package. Earlier capture gaps remain in the record; this is not a claim that the complete history of either provider was captured. Exact visible fragments preserve selected text and its source hashes without exporting full native envelopes or hidden reasoning.

| Stage | Read the account | Inspect the evidence |
