Copied source files retain their bytes; editorial summaries and path-normalized indexes are labeled separately. [The import manifest](manifest.json) records earlier source paths and hashes. Paths inside historical records identify the local lab archive, so a referenced path is not necessarily a file included in this edition.

The [timeline](../docs/timeline.md) distinguishes the time of a request, research event, archive acceptance, and later export. The [log index](../logs/README.md) leads to the retained conversations and downloadable machine-log bundles.

Run `python3 tools/verify_current_edition.py` to check preserved historical fingerprints, the new supplement, and current navigation. The earlier verifier remains unchanged and is run against an explicit historical view.
